100 × 0.95</div></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right font-medium text-slate-900">$95</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right text-slate-500">$95</td></tr><tr class=""><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-500">Base</td><td class="px-3 py-2"><div class="text-slate-800">Depreciación por km</div><div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">DEPRECIACION_KM</div><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600">Estructura de costos</span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 max-w-[16rem]"><span class="text-slate-300">—</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-600"><div>100 × 0.15</div></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right font-medium text-slate-900">$15</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right text-slate-500">$110</td></tr><tr class=""><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-500">Base</td><td class="px-3 py-2"><div class="text-slate-800">Chofer (por día)</div><div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">CHOFER_DIA</div><div class="mt-0.5 flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600">Estructura de costos</span></div></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 max-w-[16rem]"><span class="text-slate-300">—</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-slate-600"><div>1 × 28.00</div></td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right font-medium text-slate-900">$28</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-right text-slate-500">$138</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>"`;

